<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
  <meta name="author" content="Musthaque Ali">
  <meta name="copyright" content="Musthaque Ali">
  <title>I LOVE FILES — Fast, Private File Converter &amp; CAD Studio (Made by Musthaque Ali)</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free universal online file converter and CAD studio. Batch convert AutoCAD DWG &amp; DXF to PDF with exact CTB plot styles, TrueColor layers, plus PDF, Office, audio, and video conversion.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="dwg to pdf, convert dwg to pdf online, autocad batch plot online, dwg converter, dxf to pdf, pdf to word, universal file converter, ctb plot styles, cad to pdf">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://ilovefiles.southindia.cloudapp.azure.com/">

  <!-- Google Search Console Verification -->
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="googlef55b91c8df10fa26">

  <!-- OpenGraph / Social Media SEO -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://ilovefiles.southindia.cloudapp.azure.com/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="I LOVE FILES — Fast, Private File Converter &amp; CAD Studio">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Batch convert AutoCAD DWG to PDF with exact colors, CTB plot styles, plus 84+ document, image, and media formats.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="/static/logo-icon.png">

  <!-- Twitter Card -->
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="I LOVE FILES — Fast, Private File Converter &amp; CAD Studio">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Universal online converter with native AutoCAD batch plotting, exact CTB pen tables, and document studio.">

  <!-- Schema.org Structured Data for Google Rich Snippets -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebApplication",
    "name": "I LOVE FILES",
    "url": "https://ilovefiles.southindia.cloudapp.azure.com/",
    "description": "Universal online file converter and AutoCAD CAD studio supporting DWG, DXF, PDF, Word, Excel, and media files.",
    "applicationCategory": "UtilitiesApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "All",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Musthaque Ali"
    },
    "offers": {
      "@type": "Offer",
      "price": "0",
      "priceCurrency": "USD"
    }
  }
  </script>

  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/static/favicon.png">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/static/favicon.ico">
  <script>
    (function() {
      try {
        var saved = localStorage.getItem('ilovefiles_theme');
        var theme = saved || 'dark'; // Default to sleek dark UI from screenshots
        document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);
      } catch (e) {}
    })();
  </script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles.css">
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Sleek Clean Header -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="shell topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="/" onclick="switchTab('convert', true); return false;">
        <img src="/static/logo-icon.png" alt="I LOVE FILES logo">
        <span>I LOVE FILES</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <a href="#studio-bento" onclick="switchTab('convert', true)">Studio</a>
        <a href="#studio-bento" onclick="switchTab('plot', true)">AutoCAD Plot</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
        <a href="#" onclick="openPricingModal(); return false;">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="header-right">
        <!-- Direct Contact WhatsApp Chip -->
        <a href="https://wa.me/917012318459" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="header-contact-chip" title="Direct WhatsApp Support: +91 7012318459">
          <i data-lucide="phone" style="width: 12px; height: 12px; color: var(--tuckii-green);"></i>
          <span>7012318459</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Neo-Tactile Support Button -->
        <button class="neo-btn" onclick="openTicketModal()" title="Need Help? Open Support Ticket">
          <span>
            <span class="live-pulse-dot"></span>
            Help &amp; Tickets
          </span>
        </button>

        <!-- Theme Switcher -->
        <button id="theme-toggle-btn" class="theme-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="Switch Theme" aria-label="Toggle Theme">
          <i data-lucide="moon" class="theme-icon-moon" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
          <i data-lucide="sun" class="theme-icon-sun" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
        </button>

        <!-- Logged Out State -->
        <div id="auth-logged-out" class="auth-btn-group">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost-nav" onclick="openAuthModal('signin')">Sign In</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Logged In State (User Profile & Quota Dropdown) -->
        <div id="auth-logged-in" class="user-profile-wrap" style="display: none;">
          <button id="user-menu-btn" class="user-menu-trigger" onclick="toggleUserDropdown()" aria-label="User Account Menu">
            <span class="user-avatar-initials" id="user-avatar-initials">U</span>
            <span class="user-display-name" id="user-display-name">Account</span>
            <span class="badge-plan-tier" id="user-tier-badge">FREE</span>
            <i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width: 13px; height: 13px;"></i>
          </button>
          
          <div id="user-dropdown-menu" class="user-dropdown-card" style="display: none;">
            <div class="user-dropdown-header">
              <div class="user-dropdown-name" id="user-dropdown-full-name">My Account</div>
              <div class="user-dropdown-email" id="user-dropdown-email">user@example.com</div>
              <div class="user-dropdown-badge" id="user-dropdown-tier-badge">FREE PLAN</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Daily Quota Tracker -->
            <div class="user-quota-section">
              <div class="quota-meta">
                <span class="quota-label">Daily Tasks</span>
                <span class="quota-val" id="user-quota-text">0 / 5 used</span>
              </div>
              <div class="quota-bar-track">
                <div class="quota-bar-fill" id="user-quota-fill" style="width: 0%;"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="user-dropdown-divider"></div>

            <button class="user-dropdown-item pro-highlight" id="menu-upgrade-btn" onclick="openPricingModal()">
              <i data-lucide="zap" style="width: 15px; height: 15px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
              <span>Upgrade to Pro (Unlimited)</span>
            </button>
            <button class="user-dropdown-item" id="menu-portal-btn" onclick="openBillingPortal()">
              <i data-lucide="credit-card" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
              <span>Manage Subscription</span>
            </button>
            <button class="user-dropdown-item" onclick="openApiKeyModal()">
              <i data-lucide="key" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
              <span>Developer API Key</span>
            </button>
            <div class="user-dropdown-divider"></div>
            <button class="user-dropdown-item text-danger" onclick="handleSignOut()">
              <i data-lucide="log-out" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
              <span>Sign Out</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Container -->
  <main class="main-wrapper">

    <!-- ======================================================================
         TUCKII HERO SECTION
         ====================================================================== -->
    <section class="tuckii-hero">
        <div class="shell hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="hero-pill-badge" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
              <i data-lucide="sparkles" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i>
              <span>LOCAL-FIRST &bull; ZERO CLOUD HARVESTING</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-headline">Convert it now.<br>Plot it right.</h1>
            <p class="hero-lede">
              Universal file conversion and native AutoCAD batch plotting in one private, fast studio. Batch plot DWG/DXF drawings with authentic monochrome CTB styles, convert 45+ documents, images, and media — 100% on your device.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#studio-bento" class="neo-btn" style="--neo-fill: #fbb903;" onclick="switchTab('convert', true)">
                <span style="padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                  <i data-lucide="layers" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
                  Open Conversion Studio
                </span>
              </a>
              <a href="https://wa.me/917012318459" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="store-badge" title="Chat on WhatsApp: +91 7012318459">
                <i data-lucide="message-circle" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; color: #25d366;"></i>
                <span class="store-copy">
                  <span class="store-label">Direct WhatsApp / Call</span>
                  <strong>+91 7012318459</strong>
                </span>
              </a>
              <a href="mailto:musthaqueali42@gmail.com" class="store-badge" title="Direct Email: musthaqueali42@gmail.com">
                <i data-lucide="mail" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; color: #38bdf8;"></i>
                <span class="store-copy">
                  <span class="store-label">Musthaque Ali Direct Email</span>
                  <strong>musthaqueali42@gmail.com</strong>
                </span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="cta-note">No account required. No ads. Your files stay 100% on your machine.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Hero Visual Art Card -->
          <div class="hero-art-card">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 2px solid #080808; padding-bottom: 12px;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ef3f75; border: 1.5px solid #080808; display: inline-block;"></span>
                <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fbb903; border: 1.5px solid #080808; display: inline-block;"></span>
                <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #06d6a0; border: 1.5px solid #080808; display: inline-block;"></span>
              </div>
              <span style="font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 800; font-family: var(--font-mono);">AUTOCAD ENGINE &bull; 600 DPI</span>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-stone-subtle); border: 2px solid #080808; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
              <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-ink); margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <i data-lucide="check-circle" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; color: #06d6a0;"></i>
                <span>All Engines Operational</span>
              </div>
              <p style="font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">
                Native AutoCAD Core Console &bull; LibreOffice Headless &bull; Ghostscript 10.0 &bull; PyMuPDF
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px;">
              <div style="border: 2px solid #080808; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px; background: #ece8ff;">
                <div style="font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #080808;">CAD Batch Plotting</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; color: #080808;">True CTB Pen Tables</div>
              </div>
              <div style="border: 2px solid #080808; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px; background: #ffd166;">
                <div style="font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #080808;">Local Security</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; color: #080808;">Zero Cloud Uploads</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ======================================================================
           STUDIO BENTO WORKSPACE (ALL-IN-ONE POWER SUITE)
           ====================================================================== -->
      <section id="studio-bento" class="studio-section">
        <div class="shell">
          <div class="studio-bento-card">
            <div class="studio-bento-header">
              <div>
                <h2 class="studio-bento-title">Universal Studio Workspace</h2>
                <div class="studio-bento-desc">AutoCAD batch plotting, document conversion, merge &amp; compression suite</div>
              </div>
            <!-- Tactile Neo-Tabs -->
            <div class="studio-tabs" role="tablist">
              <button class="studio-tab-btn active" id="tab-btn-convert" onclick="switchTab('convert')" role="tab">
                <i data-lucide="layers" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
                <span>Universal Convert</span>
              </button>
              <button class="studio-tab-btn" id="tab-btn-plot" onclick="switchTab('plot')" role="tab">
                <i data-lucide="printer" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
                <span>AutoCAD Batch Plot</span>
              </button>
              <button class="studio-tab-btn" id="tab-btn-merge" onclick="switchTab('merge')" role="tab">
                <i data-lucide="combine" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
                <span>Merge Documents</span>
              </button>
              <button class="studio-tab-btn" id="tab-btn-resize" onclick="switchTab('resize')" role="tab">
                <i data-lucide="minimize-2" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
                <span>Compress &amp; Resize</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Studio Bento Content (holds views when on homepage) -->
          <div id="studio-bento-content">

          <!-- 1. CONVERT VIEW (FILE CONVERTER & PDF TOOLS) -->
          <div id="view-convert" class="studio-view active">
      
      <!-- Step Progression Bar -->
      <div class="zapier-step-strip">
        <div class="zapier-step active" id="step-node-1">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <div class="step-meta">
            <span class="step-title">Select Tool or File</span>
            <span class="step-sub">Choose a tool or drop a file to convert</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-connector"></div>
        <div class="zapier-step" id="step-node-2">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <div class="step-meta">
            <span class="step-title">Settings &amp; Options</span>
            <span class="step-sub">Review parameters and convert</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-connector"></div>
        <div class="zapier-step" id="step-node-3">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <div class="step-meta">
            <span class="step-title">Download</span>
            <span class="step-sub">Your file is ready</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="broadsheet-card">
        <h2 class="card-title">File Converter &amp; PDF Tools</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Convert documents, spreadsheets, CAD drawings, audio, video, and images with full precision. Select a tool below or search to get started.
        </p>

        <!-- Search & Filter Bar -->
        <div class="hub-search-container">
          <div class="hub-search-box">
            <i data-lucide="search" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
            <input 
              type="search" 
              id="hub-search-input" 
              name="search_catalog_query" 
              autocomplete="off" 
              autocorrect="off" 
              autocapitalize="off" 
              spellcheck="false" 
              data-lpignore="true" 
              data-form-type="other"
              readonly
              onfocus="this.removeAttribute('readonly');"
              placeholder="Search tools (e.g. Word to PDF, Split PDF, Excel, Protect, Compress...)" 
              oninput="filterToolCards(this.value)">
          </div>
          <div class="hub-filter-pills">
            <button class="filter-pill active" id="pill-all" onclick="filterCategory('all')">All Tools</button>
            <button class="filter-pill" id="pill-pdf-suite" onclick="filterCategory('pdf-suite')">PDF Tools</button>
            <button class="filter-pill" id="pill-office" onclick="filterCategory('office')">Office</button>
            <button class="filter-pill" id="pill-cad" onclick="filterCategory('cad')">CAD</button>
            <button class="filter-pill" id="pill-audio" onclick="filterCategory('audio')">Audio &amp; Music</button>
            <button class="filter-pill" id="pill-video" onclick="filterCategory('video')">Video</button>
            <button class="filter-pill" id="pill-image" onclick="filterCategory('image')">Images</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tool Catalog Grid -->
        <div class="tool-grid" id="tools-catalog-grid">
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-word-to-pdf" data-tool="word-to-pdf" data-category="office" data-ext=".docx,.doc" onclick="selectQuickTool('word-to-pdf', 'Word to PDF', '.docx,.doc')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-blue"><span>W</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Word to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-excel-to-pdf" data-tool="excel-to-pdf" data-category="office" data-ext=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" onclick="selectQuickTool('excel-to-pdf', 'Excel to PDF', '.xlsx,.xls,.csv')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-green"><span>X</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Excel to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-ppt-to-pdf" data-tool="ppt-to-pdf" data-category="office" data-ext=".pptx,.ppt" onclick="selectQuickTool('ppt-to-pdf', 'PowerPoint to PDF', '.pptx,.ppt')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-orange"><span>P</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PowerPoint to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-jpg-to-pdf" data-tool="jpg-to-pdf" data-category="image" data-ext=".jpg,.jpeg" onclick="selectQuickTool('jpg-to-pdf', 'JPG to PDF', '.jpg,.jpeg')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-purple"><span>IMG</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">JPG to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-png-to-pdf" data-tool="png-to-pdf" data-category="image" data-ext=".png" onclick="selectQuickTool('png-to-pdf', 'PNG to PDF', '.png')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-purple"><span>PNG</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PNG to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-heic-to-pdf" data-tool="heic-to-pdf" data-category="image" data-ext=".heic,.heif" onclick="selectQuickTool('heic-to-pdf', 'HEIC to PDF', '.heic,.heif')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-purple"><span>HEIC</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">HEIC to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-autocad-to-pdf" data-tool="autocad-to-pdf" data-category="cad" data-ext=".dwg,.dxf" onclick="selectQuickTool('autocad-to-pdf', 'AutoCAD to PDF', '.dwg,.dxf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>A</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">AutoCAD to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-dwg-to-dwf" data-tool="dwg-to-dwf" data-category="cad" data-ext=".dwg" onclick="selectQuickTool('dwg-to-dwf', 'DWG to DWF', '.dwg')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>DWF</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">DWG to DWF / DWFx</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-dwf-to-dwg" data-tool="dwf-to-dwg" data-category="cad" data-ext=".dwf,.dwfx" onclick="selectQuickTool('dwf-to-dwg', 'DWF to DWG', '.dwf,.dwfx')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>DWG</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">DWF to AutoCAD DWG</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-dwg-to-dxf" data-tool="dwg-to-dxf" data-category="cad" data-ext=".dwg" onclick="selectQuickTool('dwg-to-dxf', 'DWG to DXF', '.dwg')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>DXF</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">DWG to DXF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-dxf-to-dwg" data-tool="dxf-to-dwg" data-category="cad" data-ext=".dxf" onclick="selectQuickTool('dxf-to-dwg', 'DXF to DWG', '.dxf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>CAD</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">DXF to DWG</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-to-cad" data-tool="pdf-to-cad" data-category="cad" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-to-cad', 'PDF to AutoCAD DWG', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>VEC</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF to AutoCAD DWG</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Audio & Music Converters -->
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-audio-to-mp3" data-tool="audio-to-mp3" data-category="audio" data-ext=".wav,.flac,.aac,.ogg,.m4a,.opus,.wma,.aiff,.ac3,.amr,.m4r,.mp2,.caf,.au" onclick="selectQuickTool('audio-to-mp3', 'Audio to MP3', '.wav,.flac,.aac,.ogg,.m4a,.opus,.wma,.aiff,.ac3,.amr,.m4r,.mp2,.caf,.au')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>MP3</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Audio to MP3</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-audio-to-wav" data-tool="audio-to-wav" data-category="audio" data-ext=".mp3,.flac,.aac,.ogg,.m4a,.wma,.opus,.aiff" onclick="selectQuickTool('audio-to-wav', 'Audio to WAV', '.mp3,.flac,.aac,.ogg,.m4a,.wma,.opus,.aiff')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>WAV</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Audio to WAV</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-audio-to-flac" data-tool="audio-to-flac" data-category="audio" data-ext=".mp3,.wav,.aac,.ogg,.m4a,.wma" onclick="selectQuickTool('audio-to-flac', 'Audio to FLAC', '.mp3,.wav,.aac,.ogg,.m4a,.wma')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>FLAC</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Audio to FLAC (Lossless)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-audio-to-m4a" data-tool="audio-to-m4a" data-category="audio" data-ext=".mp3,.wav,.flac,.ogg,.wma" onclick="selectQuickTool('audio-to-m4a', 'Audio to M4A / AAC', '.mp3,.wav,.flac,.ogg,.wma')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>M4A</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Audio to M4A / AAC</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Video Converters -->
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-video-to-mp4" data-tool="video-to-mp4" data-category="video" data-ext=".mkv,.avi,.mov,.webm,.flv,.wmv,.m4v,.3gp,.ts,.vob,.mpg" onclick="selectQuickTool('video-to-mp4', 'Video to MP4', '.mkv,.avi,.mov,.webm,.flv,.wmv,.m4v,.3gp,.ts,.vob,.mpg')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-dark"><span>MP4</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Video to MP4</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-video-to-mp3" data-tool="video-to-mp3" data-category="video" data-ext=".mp4,.mkv,.avi,.mov,.webm,.flv,.wmv,.m4v,.3gp,.ts" onclick="selectQuickTool('video-to-mp3', 'Video to MP3 (Audio Extraction)', '.mp4,.mkv,.avi,.mov,.webm,.flv,.wmv,.m4v,.3gp,.ts')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>AUDIO</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Video to MP3 (Extract)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-video-to-gif" data-tool="video-to-gif" data-category="video" data-ext=".mp4,.mov,.avi,.webm,.mkv" onclick="selectQuickTool('video-to-gif', 'Video to Animated GIF', '.mp4,.mov,.avi,.webm,.mkv')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-purple"><span>GIF</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Video to Animated GIF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-gif-to-mp4" data-tool="gif-to-mp4" data-category="video" data-ext=".gif" onclick="selectQuickTool('gif-to-mp4', 'GIF to MP4 Video', '.gif')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-dark"><span>V-GIF</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">GIF to MP4 Video</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-video-to-webm" data-tool="video-to-webm" data-category="video" data-ext=".mp4,.mov,.avi,.mkv" onclick="selectQuickTool('video-to-webm', 'Video to WebM', '.mp4,.mov,.avi,.mkv')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-dark"><span>WEBM</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Video to WebM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-openoffice-to-pdf" data-tool="openoffice-to-pdf" data-category="office" data-ext=".odt,.ods,.odp" onclick="selectQuickTool('openoffice-to-pdf', 'OpenOffice to PDF', '.odt,.ods,.odp')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-blue"><span>ODT</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">OpenOffice to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-ebook-to-pdf" data-tool="ebook-to-pdf" data-category="office" data-ext=".epub,.mobi,.fb2" onclick="selectQuickTool('ebook-to-pdf', 'eBooks to PDF', '.epub,.mobi,.fb2')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-orange"><span>EPUB</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">eBooks to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-iwork-to-pdf" data-tool="iwork-to-pdf" data-category="office" data-ext=".pages,.numbers,.keynote" onclick="selectQuickTool('iwork-to-pdf', 'iWork to PDF', '.pages,.numbers,.keynote')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-dark"><span>iWork</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">iWork to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-publisher-to-pdf" data-tool="publisher-to-pdf" data-category="office" data-ext=".pub" onclick="selectQuickTool('publisher-to-pdf', 'Publisher to PDF', '.pub')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-green"><span>PUB</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Publisher to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-dicom-to-pdf" data-tool="dicom-to-pdf" data-category="image" data-ext=".dcm,.dicom" onclick="selectQuickTool('dicom-to-pdf', 'DICOM to PDF', '.dcm,.dicom')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>DCM</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">DICOM to PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-to-word" data-tool="pdf-to-word" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-to-word', 'PDF to Word', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-blue"><span>DOCX</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF to Word</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-to-excel" data-tool="pdf-to-excel" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-to-excel', 'PDF to Excel', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-green"><span>XLSX</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF to Excel</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-to-pptx" data-tool="pdf-to-pptx" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-to-pptx', 'PDF to PowerPoint', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-orange"><span>PPTX</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF to PowerPoint</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-to-jpg" data-tool="pdf-to-jpg" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-to-jpg', 'PDF to JPG', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-purple"><span>JPG</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF to JPG</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-to-png" data-tool="pdf-to-png" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-to-png', 'PDF to PNG', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-purple"><span>PNG</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF to PNG</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-extract-images" data-tool="extract-images" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('extract-images', 'Extract Images', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-purple"><span>EXT</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Extract Images</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-to-pdfa" data-tool="pdf-to-pdfa" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-to-pdfa', 'PDF to PDF/A', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-dark"><span>PDF/A</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF to PDF/A</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-merge-pdf" data-tool="merge-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="switchTab('merge')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-orange"><span>PDF</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Merge PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-split-pdf" data-tool="split-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('split-pdf', 'Split PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-orange"><span>CUT</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Split PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-protect-pdf" data-tool="protect-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('protect-pdf', 'Protect PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>AES</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Protect PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-unlock-pdf" data-tool="unlock-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('unlock-pdf', 'Unlock PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>KEY</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Unlock PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-redact-pdf" data-tool="redact-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('redact-pdf', 'Redact PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-teal"><span>BLK</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Redact PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-pdf-converter" data-tool="pdf-converter" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('pdf-converter', 'PDF Converter', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>ALL</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">PDF Converter</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-compress-pdf" data-tool="compress-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="switchTab('resize')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>ZIP</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Compress PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-delete-pages" data-tool="delete-pages" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('delete-pages', 'Delete PDF Pages', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>DEL</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Delete PDF Pages</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-rotate-pdf" data-tool="rotate-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('rotate-pdf', 'Rotate PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>90°</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Rotate PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-flatten-pdf" data-tool="flatten-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('flatten-pdf', 'Flatten PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>FLT</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Flatten PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-repair-pdf" data-tool="repair-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('repair-pdf', 'Repair PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>FIX</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Repair PDF</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-card" id="card-print-ready-pdf" data-tool="print-ready-pdf" data-category="pdf-suite" data-ext=".pdf" onclick="selectQuickTool('print-ready-pdf', 'Print-Ready PDF', '.pdf')">
            <div class="tool-icon-wrap icon-red"><span>300DPI</span></div>
            <div class="tool-label">Print-Ready PDF</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Contextual Configuration Drawer -->
        <div id="context-config-drawer" class="context-panel" style="display: none;">
          <div class="context-header">
            <div class="context-title">
              <i data-lucide="sliders" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
              <span id="drawer-tool-title">Tool Configuration</span>
            </div>
            <span id="drawer-tool-badge" class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 0; background: var(--bg-stone); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600;">Step 2</span>
          </div>
          
          <p id="drawer-tool-desc" class="context-desc">
            Choose or drop your file below to proceed.
          </p>

          <!-- Dropzone -->
          <div class="broadsheet-dropzone" id="convert-dropzone" onclick="document.getElementById('convert-file-input').click()">
            <input type="file" id="convert-file-input" style="display: none;" onchange="handleConvertFileSelect(this.files)">
            <div class="drop-icon">
              <i data-lucide="upload-cloud" style="width: 26px; height: 26px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="drop-title" id="drawer-drop-title">Choose a file or drag it here</div>
            <div class="drop-desc" id="drawer-drop-desc">Supports PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, CAD drawings, Audio, Video, and images</div>
          </div>

          <!-- File Loaded Strip -->
          <div id="convert-file-info" class="file-loaded-strip" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <div class="file-loaded-left">
              <div class="file-loaded-icon">
                <i data-lucide="file-check" style="width: 22px; height: 22px;"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div id="convert-filename" class="file-loaded-name">document.pdf</div>
                <div id="convert-filesize" class="file-loaded-meta">1.2 MB &bull; PDF</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button class="file-loaded-remove" onclick="clearConvertFile(event)" title="Remove File">
              <i data-lucide="x" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Contextual Tool Options -->
          <div id="dynamic-tool-options" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            
            <!-- Split PDF Options -->
            <div id="opt-split-pdf" class="tool-opt-panel" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">SPLIT MODE &amp; PAGE RANGES</label>
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem;">
                <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.88rem;">
                  <input type="radio" name="split_mode" value="range" checked onchange="toggleSplitMode()"> Page Ranges (e.g. 1-3, 5)
                </label>
                <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.88rem;">
                  <input type="radio" name="split_mode" value="burst" onchange="toggleSplitMode()"> Split Every Page
                </label>
              </div>
              <input type="text" id="split-range-input" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="e.g. 1-3, 5, 8-10">
            </div>

            <!-- Rotate PDF Options -->
            <div id="opt-rotate-pdf" class="tool-opt-panel" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">ROTATION ANGLE</label>
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.35rem;">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary opt-angle-btn active" onclick="setRotateAngle(90, this)">90° Clockwise</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary opt-angle-btn" onclick="setRotateAngle(180, this)">180° Flip</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary opt-angle-btn" onclick="setRotateAngle(270, this)">270° Counter-Clockwise</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Delete Pages Options -->
            <div id="opt-delete-pages" class="tool-opt-panel" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">PAGE NUMBERS TO REMOVE</label>
              <input type="text" id="delete-pages-input" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="e.g. 2, 4, 6-8">
            </div>

            <!-- Protect PDF Options -->
            <div id="opt-protect-pdf" class="tool-opt-panel" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">SET PASSWORD</label>
              <input type="password" id="protect-password-input" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="Enter secure password to protect PDF...">
            </div>

            <!-- Unlock PDF Options -->
            <div id="opt-unlock-pdf" class="tool-opt-panel" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">CURRENT PASSWORD</label>
              <input type="password" id="unlock-password-input" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="Enter password to unlock...">
            </div>

            <!-- Redact PDF Options -->
            <div id="opt-redact-pdf" class="tool-opt-panel" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">WORDS TO BLACKOUT (REDACT)</label>
              <input type="text" id="redact-keywords-input" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="e.g. Confidential, Internal, SSN">
            </div>

            <!-- Print-Ready PDF Options -->
            <div id="opt-print-ready-pdf" class="tool-opt-panel" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">PRINT RESOLUTION (DPI)</label>
              <select id="print-dpi-select" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="300" selected>300 DPI (High Quality Print Standard)</option>
                <option value="600">600 DPI (Ultra-HD Vector Blueprint Quality)</option>
                <option value="150">150 DPI (Fast Proofing Quality)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <!-- Target Format Preset Banner (For dedicated tools like Excel to PDF) -->
            <div id="convert-target-preset" class="use-case-note" style="display: none; background-color: #ecfdf5; border-left: 3px solid #16a34a; color: #15803d;">
              <i data-lucide="check-circle" style="width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #16a34a;"></i>
              <span id="convert-target-preset-text">Target Format: <strong>PDF Document (.pdf)</strong></span>
            </div>

            <!-- Target Format Selector (For general conversions ONLY) -->
            <div id="convert-target-wrap" class="control-group" style="display: none;">
              <label class="control-label">TARGET FORMAT</label>
              <select id="convert-target-select" class="broadsheet-select" onchange="onTargetFormatChange()">
                <option value="">Select format...</option>
              </select>
              <div id="convert-use-case-note" class="use-case-note" style="display: none; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
                <i data-lucide="info" style="width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
                <span id="convert-use-case-text"></span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- PDF Page Selector (When converting multi-page PDF to images) -->
            <div id="pdf-page-selector-wrap" class="control-group" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
              <label class="control-label" for="pdf-page-select">PAGES TO CONVERT</label>
              <select id="pdf-page-select" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="all">All Pages (Download as ZIP Archive)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <!-- CAD Drawing Plot Style Selector (When converting DWG/DXF in Converter tab) -->
            <div id="cad-plot-style-wrap" class="control-group" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
              <label class="control-label" for="convert-cad-plot-style">CAD PLOT STYLE &amp; COLORS</label>
              <select id="convert-cad-plot-style" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="acad.ctb" selected>acad.ctb (Exact Native AutoCAD Drawing Colors - As in AutoCAD)</option>
                <option value="Circuitizer.ctb">Circuitizer.ctb (Circuitizer Standard Plot Style)</option>
                <option value="monochrome.ctb">monochrome.ctb (Monochrome Black &amp; White)</option>
                <option value="BW.ctb">BW.ctb (High-Contrast Black &amp; White)</option>
                <option value="CVX-CML-PASC.ctb">CVX-CML-PASC.ctb (Chevron CML Inspection Colors)</option>
                <option value="None">None (Unassigned / Drawing Default)</option>
              </select>
              <div class="use-case-note" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; background: var(--bg-bone-subtle);">
                <i data-lucide="palette" style="width: 15px; height: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--accent-ember);"></i>
                <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-ink);">Selected plot style controls vector pen colors and lineweights matching native AutoCAD drafting.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Execute Button -->
          <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            <button id="convert-submit-btn" class="btn btn-ember" disabled onclick="executeConvert()">
              <i data-lucide="zap" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
              <span id="convert-btn-text">Convert File</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Progress -->
          <div id="convert-progress-wrap" class="progress-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <div class="progress-meta">
              <span id="convert-progress-stage">Processing...</span>
              <span id="convert-progress-percent">0%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-track">
              <div id="convert-progress-bar" class="progress-bar"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Error Banner -->
          <div id="convert-error-banner" class="error-banner" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1;">
              <i data-lucide="alert-circle" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
              <span id="convert-error-text">Operation failed</span>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="error-banner-ticket-btn" onclick="openTicketFromError('convert')" title="Report this error to Musthaque Ali">
              <i data-lucide="life-buoy" style="width: 12px; height: 12px;"></i>
              <span>Get Help / Open Ticket</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="document.getElementById('convert-error-banner').style.display='none'" style="background: none; border: none; color: inherit; cursor: pointer;">
              <i data-lucide="x" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Result Card -->
          <div id="convert-result-card" class="result-card" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <div class="result-header">
              <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; color: #16a34a;"></i>
              <span>Conversion Complete</span>
            </div>
            <div class="result-metrics">
              <span id="convert-result-metrics">Processed in 120ms</span>
              <span id="convert-result-savings" class="badge" style="display: none; margin-left: 0.5rem; background: #ecfdf5; color: #15803d; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 9999px;"></span>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <a id="convert-download-btn" href="#" class="btn btn-primary" download>
                <i data-lucide="download" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i> Download File
              </a>
              <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="clearConvertFile()">
                <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i> Convert Another File
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================================
         2. AUTOCAD BATCH PLOT & PUBLISHING STUDIO
         ====================================================================== -->
    <div id="view-plot" class="studio-view">
      <div class="broadsheet-card">
        <h2 class="card-title">AutoCAD Batch Plotting</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Plot multiple DWG and DXF drawings with your preferred CTB plot styles, paper sizes, and orientations into continuous multi-page PDF sets or ZIP archives.
        </p>

        <!-- AutoCAD Plot Settings Grid -->
        <div class="grid-2col">
          
          <!-- Left Column -->
          <div>
            <div class="control-group">
              <label class="control-label" for="plot-printer">PLOTTER / QUALITY</label>
              <select id="plot-printer" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="AutoCAD PDF (High Quality Print).pc3" selected>AutoCAD PDF (High Quality Print)</option>
                <option value="AutoCAD PDF (General Documentation).pc3">AutoCAD PDF (General Documentation)</option>
                <option value="AutoCAD PDF (Smallest File).pc3">AutoCAD PDF (Smallest File)</option>
                <option value="AutoCAD PDF (Web and Mobile).pc3">AutoCAD PDF (Web and Mobile)</option>
                <option value="DWG To PDF.pc3">DWG To PDF</option>
                <option value="DWF6 ePlot.pc3">DWF6 ePlot (Autodesk DWF)</option>
                <option value="DWFx ePlot (XPS Compatible).pc3">DWFx ePlot (XPS Compatible)</option>
                <option value="PublishToWeb PNG.pc3">PublishToWeb PNG (Raster)</option>
                <option value="PublishToWeb JPG.pc3">PublishToWeb JPG (Raster)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="control-group">
              <label class="control-label" for="plot-paper-size">PAPER SIZE</label>
              <select id="plot-paper-size" class="broadsheet-select">
                <optgroup label="ANSI Standard Sheets">
                  <option value="ANSI full bleed B (17.00 x 11.00 Inches)" selected>ANSI full bleed B (17.00 x 11.00 Inches)</option>
                  <option value="ANSI full bleed A (11.00 x 8.50 Inches)">ANSI full bleed A (11.00 x 8.50 Inches)</option>
                  <option value="ANSI A (8.50 x 11.00 Inches)">ANSI A (8.50 x 11.00 Inches)</option>
                  <option value="ANSI B (11.00 x 17.00 Inches)">ANSI B (11.00 x 17.00 Inches)</option>
                  <option value="ANSI C (17.00 x 22.00 Inches)">ANSI C (17.00 x 22.00 Inches)</option>
                  <option value="ANSI D (22.00 x 34.00 Inches)">ANSI D (22.00 x 34.00 Inches)</option>
                  <option value="ANSI E (34.00 x 44.00 Inches)">ANSI E (34.00 x 44.00 Inches)</option>
                </optgroup>
                <optgroup label="ISO International Metric Sheets">
                  <option value="ISO full bleed A4 (210.00 x 297.00 mm)">ISO full bleed A4 (210.00 x 297.00 mm)</option>
                  <option value="ISO full bleed A3 (297.00 x 420.00 mm)">ISO full bleed A3 (297.00 x 420.00 mm)</option>
                  <option value="ISO full bleed A2 (420.00 x 594.00 mm)">ISO full bleed A2 (420.00 x 594.00 mm)</option>
                  <option value="ISO full bleed A1 (841.00 x 594.00 mm)">ISO full bleed A1 (841.00 x 594.00 mm)</option>
                  <option value="ISO full bleed A0 (1189.00 x 841.00 mm)">ISO full bleed A0 (1189.00 x 841.00 mm)</option>
                </optgroup>
                <optgroup label="Architectural Sheets">
                  <option value="ARCH full bleed D (24.00 x 36.00 Inches)">ARCH full bleed D (24.00 x 36.00 Inches)</option>
                  <option value="ARCH E (36.00 x 48.00 Inches)">ARCH E (36.00 x 48.00 Inches)</option>
                </optgroup>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-subgrid-2col">
              <div>
                <label class="control-label" for="plot-area">WHAT TO PLOT</label>
                <select id="plot-area" class="broadsheet-select">
                  <option value="Extents" selected>Extents (Standard)</option>
                  <option value="Display">Display</option>
                  <option value="Limits">Limits</option>
                  <option value="Layout">Layout (Paper Space)</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="control-label" for="plot-shade">SHADE PLOT</label>
                <select id="plot-shade" class="broadsheet-select">
                  <option value="Wireframe" selected>Wireframe</option>
                  <option value="As displayed">As Displayed</option>
                  <option value="Hidden">Hidden</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.88rem;">
                <input type="checkbox" id="plot-fit" checked>
                <strong>Fit to Paper</strong>
              </label>
              <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.88rem;">
                <input type="checkbox" id="plot-center" checked>
                <strong>Center the Plot</strong>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right Column -->
          <div>
            <div class="control-group">
              <label class="control-label" for="plot-style">PLOT STYLE (CTB PEN ASSIGNMENTS)</label>
              <select id="plot-style" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="acad.ctb" selected>acad.ctb (Exact Native AutoCAD Drawing Colors - As in AutoCAD)</option>
                <option value="Circuitizer.ctb">Circuitizer.ctb (Circuitizer Standard Plot Style)</option>
                <option value="monochrome.ctb">monochrome.ctb (Standard Black &amp; White)</option>
                <option value="BW.ctb">BW.ctb (High Contrast Black &amp; White)</option>
                <option value="CVX-CML-PASC.ctb">CVX-CML-PASC.ctb (Chevron CML Inspection Colors)</option>
                <option value="Grayscale.ctb">Grayscale.ctb</option>
                <option value="DWF Virtual Pens.ctb">DWF Virtual Pens.ctb</option>
                <option value="Screening 100%.ctb">Screening 100%</option>
                <option value="Screening 50%.ctb">Screening 50%</option>
                <option value="Screening 25%.ctb">Screening 25%</option>
                <option value="None">None (Unassigned / Drawing Default)</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <!-- Custom CTB Upload -->
            <div style="margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px dashed var(--border-ash); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--bg-stone-subtle);">
              <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem;">CUSTOM .CTB STYLE</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Optional: upload a custom company plot style</div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.78rem;" onclick="document.getElementById('plot-ctb-file').click()">
                  <i data-lucide="upload" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i> Attach .CTB
                </button>
                <input type="file" id="plot-ctb-file" accept=".ctb" style="display: none;" onchange="handleCtbFileSelect(this.files)">
              </div>
              <div id="plot-ctb-loaded-badge" style="display: none; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--zapier-orange); font-weight: 700;">
                <i data-lucide="check-circle" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;"></i> Attached: <span id="plot-ctb-filename">Circuitizer.ctb</span>
                <button type="button" onclick="clearCustomCtb()" style="background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-ink); margin-left: 0.5rem; text-decoration: underline;">Remove</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-subgrid-2col">
              <div>
                <label class="control-label">ORIENTATION</label>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem;">
                  <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem;">
                    <input type="radio" name="plot_orientation" value="Landscape" checked id="plot-orient-land">
                    <span>Landscape</span>
                  </label>
                  <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem;">
                    <input type="radio" name="plot_orientation" value="Portrait" id="plot-orient-port">
                    <span>Portrait</span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="control-label">OPTIONS</label>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem;">
                  <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem;">
                    <input type="checkbox" id="plot-lineweights" checked>
                    <span>Plot Lineweights</span>
                  </label>
                  <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem;">
                    <input type="checkbox" id="plot-styles-enabled" checked>
                    <span>Use Plot Styles</span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Batch Drawing Dropzone -->
        <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <div class="broadsheet-dropzone" id="plot-dropzone" onclick="document.getElementById('plot-file-input').click()">
            <input type="file" id="plot-file-input" multiple accept=".dwg,.dxf" style="display: none;" onchange="handlePlotFilesSelect(this.files)">
            <div class="drop-icon">
              <i data-lucide="files" style="width: 26px; height: 26px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="drop-title">Choose or drop AutoCAD drawings here</div>
            <div class="drop-desc">Select DWG or DXF files to batch plot</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Batch Queue File Strip -->
          <div id="plot-queue-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;" id="plot-queue-count-label">Batch Drawing Queue (0 Drawings)</span>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.78rem;" onclick="document.getElementById('plot-file-input').click()">
                <i data-lucide="plus" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i> Add More Drawings
              </button>
            </div>
            <div id="plot-queue-list" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; max-height: 220px; overflow-y: auto;"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Output Packaging Options -->
          <div style="margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-ash); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--bg-stone-subtle);">
            <label class="control-label">OUTPUT PACKAGING</label>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.45rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.88rem;">
                <input type="radio" name="plot_packaging" value="unified" checked id="plot-pack-unified">
                <strong>Combined Multi-Page Document (PDF / DWF)</strong>
              </label>
              <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.88rem;">
                <input type="radio" name="plot_packaging" value="zip" id="plot-pack-zip">
                <span>Separate Files (Download as ZIP Archive)</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Error Banner -->
          <div id="plot-error-banner" class="error-banner" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1;">
              <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
              <span id="plot-error-text">An error occurred during plotting.</span>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="error-banner-ticket-btn" onclick="openTicketFromError('plot')" title="Report plotting error to Musthaque Ali">
              <i data-lucide="life-buoy" style="width: 12px; height: 12px;"></i>
              <span>Get Help / Open Ticket</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="document.getElementById('plot-error-banner').style.display='none'" style="background: none; border: none; color: inherit; cursor: pointer;">
              <i data-lucide="x" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Action Button -->
          <div style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
            <button class="btn btn-ember" id="plot-submit-btn" onclick="submitAutoCadBatchPlot()" disabled>
              <i data-lucide="printer" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
              <span id="plot-submit-btn-text">Execute AutoCAD Batch Plot</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Progress Track -->
          <div id="plot-progress-wrap" class="progress-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
            <div class="progress-meta">
              <span id="plot-prog-status">Plotting...</span>
              <span id="plot-prog-percent">0%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-track">
              <div id="plot-progress-fill" class="progress-bar"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Result Card (with all required result IDs) -->
          <div id="plot-result-card" class="result-card" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            <div class="result-header">
              <i data-lucide="check-circle" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; color: #16a34a;"></i>
              <span>Batch Plot Complete</span>
            </div>

            <div class="result-metrics" style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <div>Sheets: <strong id="plot-res-sheets" style="color: var(--text-ink);">1</strong></div>
              <div>File Size: <strong id="plot-res-size" style="color: var(--text-ink);">0 KB</strong></div>
              <div>Plot Style: <strong id="plot-res-ctb" style="color: var(--text-ink);">acad.ctb</strong></div>
              <div>Duration: <strong id="plot-res-duration" style="color: var(--text-ink);">0s</strong></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Live Sheet 1 Preview -->
            <div id="plot-preview-container" style="display: none; margin: 1rem 0; border: 1px solid var(--border-ash); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: #ffffff; padding: 0.75rem; text-align: center;">
              <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-align: left;">
                Drawing Preview (Sheet 1)
              </div>
              <img id="plot-preview-img" src="" alt="Sheet 1 Preview" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 420px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1rem;">
              <a id="plot-download-btn" href="#" class="btn btn-primary" download>
                <i data-lucide="download" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i> Download Plotted Drawing Set
              </a>
              <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="resetPlotStudio()">
                <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i> Plot Another Batch
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================================
         3. DOCUMENT MERGER VIEW
         ====================================================================== -->
    <div id="view-merge" class="studio-view">
      <div class="broadsheet-card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Merge Documents</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Combine multiple PDF files, Word documents (.docx), and images (.png, .jpg, .webp, .tiff) into a single PDF. Drag and drop entries to arrange page sequence.
        </p>

        <!-- Dropzone -->
        <div class="broadsheet-dropzone" id="merge-dropzone" onclick="document.getElementById('merge-file-input').click()">
          <input type="file" id="merge-file-input" style="display: none;" multiple onchange="handleMergeFilesSelect(this.files)">
          <div class="drop-icon">
            <i data-lucide="layers" style="width: 26px; height: 26px;"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="drop-title">Choose files to merge</div>
          <div class="drop-desc">Select 2 or more files (PDF, DOCX, PNG, JPG, WebP, TIFF)</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Merge Queue List -->
        <div id="merge-queue-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-ash); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;" id="merge-count-label">Queue (0 Files)</span>
            <button class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.78rem;" onclick="clearMergeQueue()">
              <i data-lucide="trash-2" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i> Clear All
            </button>
          </div>
          <div id="merge-file-list" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Error Banner -->
        <div id="merge-error-banner" class="error-banner" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1;">
            <i data-lucide="alert-circle" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            <span id="merge-error-text">An error occurred.</span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="error-banner-ticket-btn" onclick="openTicketFromError('merge')" title="Report merge issue to Musthaque Ali">
            <i data-lucide="life-buoy" style="width: 12px; height: 12px;"></i>
            <span>Get Help / Open Ticket</span>
          </button>
          <button onclick="document.getElementById('merge-error-banner').style.display='none'" style="background: none; border: none; color: inherit; cursor: pointer;">
            <i data-lucide="x" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Button -->
        <div style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <button class="btn btn-ember" id="merge-submit-btn" disabled onclick="executeMerge()">
            <i data-lucide="combine" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
            <span id="merge-btn-text">Merge Files into Single PDF</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Progress Track -->
        <div id="merge-progress-wrap" class="progress-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <div class="progress-meta">
            <span id="merge-prog-status">Merging files...</span>
            <span id="merge-prog-percent">0%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track">
            <div id="merge-progress-bar" class="progress-bar"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Result Card -->
        <div id="merge-result-card" class="result-card" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <div class="result-header">
            <i data-lucide="check-circle" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; color: #16a34a;"></i>
            <span>Merge Complete</span>
          </div>
          <div class="result-metrics">
            <span id="merge-result-metrics">Merged 0 files</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <a id="merge-download-btn" href="#" class="btn btn-primary" download>
              <i data-lucide="download" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i> Download Merged PDF
            </a>
            <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="clearMergeQueue()">
              <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i> Merge Another Set
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================================
         4. RESIZE & COMPRESS VIEW
         ====================================================================== -->
    <div id="view-resize" class="studio-view">
      <div class="broadsheet-card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Compress &amp; Resize Files</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Reduce PDF document size, optimize and resize images, or downscale video files.
        </p>

        <!-- Sub-tabs -->
        <div class="hub-filter-pills" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <button class="filter-pill active" id="resize-subtab-pdf" onclick="switchResizeSubTab('pdf')">
            <i data-lucide="file-text" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;"></i> PDF Document
          </button>
          <button class="filter-pill" id="resize-subtab-image" onclick="switchResizeSubTab('image')">
            <i data-lucide="image" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;"></i> Images
          </button>
          <button class="filter-pill" id="resize-subtab-video" onclick="switchResizeSubTab('video')">
            <i data-lucide="video" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;"></i> Video
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Controls: PDF -->
        <div id="controls-pdf" class="resize-controls-panel">
          <div class="form-subgrid-2col">
            <div>
              <label class="control-label" for="pdf-page-size">PAGE SIZE NORMALIZATION</label>
              <select id="pdf-page-size" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="keep" selected>Keep Original Page Size</option>
                <option value="a4">Standard A4 (210 x 297 mm)</option>
                <option value="letter">US Letter (8.5 x 11 in)</option>
                <option value="a3">Standard A3 (297 x 420 mm)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="control-label" for="pdf-target-kb">TARGET FILE SIZE</label>
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem;">
                <input type="number" id="pdf-target-kb" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="e.g. 500">
                <select id="pdf-size-unit" class="broadsheet-select" style="width: 90px;">
                  <option value="kb" selected>KB</option>
                  <option value="mb">MB</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Controls: Image -->
        <div id="controls-image" class="resize-controls-panel" style="display: none;">
          <div class="form-subgrid-3col">
            <div>
              <label class="control-label" for="img-width">MAX WIDTH (PX)</label>
              <input type="number" id="img-width" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="e.g. 1920">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="control-label" for="img-height">MAX HEIGHT (PX)</label>
              <input type="number" id="img-height" class="broadsheet-input" placeholder="e.g. 1080">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="control-label" for="img-quality">QUALITY (%)</label>
              <input type="number" id="img-quality" class="broadsheet-input" value="85" min="10" max="100">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Controls: Video -->
        <div id="controls-video" class="resize-controls-panel" style="display: none;">
          <div class="form-subgrid-2col">
            <div>
              <label class="control-label" for="video-resolution">RESOLUTION</label>
              <select id="video-resolution" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="720p" selected>720p HD (1280x720)</option>
                <option value="480p">480p SD (854x480)</option>
                <option value="360p">360p Low (640x360)</option>
                <option value="1080p">1080p Full HD (1920x1080)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="control-label" for="video-bitrate">TARGET BITRATE</label>
              <select id="video-bitrate" class="broadsheet-select">
                <option value="1M" selected>1.0 Mbps (Recommended)</option>
                <option value="500k">500 Kbps (Maximum Compression)</option>
                <option value="2M">2.0 Mbps (High Quality)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dropzone -->
        <div class="broadsheet-dropzone" id="resize-dropzone" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;" onclick="document.getElementById('resize-file-input').click()">
          <input type="file" id="resize-file-input" style="display: none;" onchange="handleResizeFileSelect(this.files)">
          <div class="drop-icon">
            <i data-lucide="minimize-2" style="width: 26px; height: 26px;"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="drop-title" id="resize-drop-title">Choose a file to compress or resize</div>
          <div class="drop-desc" id="resize-drop-desc">Select PDF, image, or video file</div>
        </div>

        <!-- File Loaded Strip -->
        <div id="resize-file-info" class="file-loaded-strip" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div class="file-loaded-left">
            <div class="file-loaded-icon">
              <i data-lucide="file-check" style="width: 22px; height: 22px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div id="resize-filename" class="file-loaded-name">document.pdf</div>
              <div id="resize-filesize" class="file-loaded-meta">1.2 MB &bull; PDF</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="file-loaded-remove" onclick="clearResizeFile(event)" title="Remove File">
            <i data-lucide="x" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Error Banner -->
        <div id="resize-error-banner" class="error-banner" style="display: none; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1;">
            <i data-lucide="alert-circle" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            <span id="resize-error-text">An error occurred.</span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="error-banner-ticket-btn" onclick="openTicketFromError('resize')" title="Report resize issue to Musthaque Ali">
            <i data-lucide="life-buoy" style="width: 12px; height: 12px;"></i>
            <span>Get Help / Open Ticket</span>
          </button>
          <button onclick="document.getElementById('resize-error-banner').style.display='none'" style="background: none; border: none; color: inherit; cursor: pointer;">
              <i data-lucide="x" style="width: 15px; height: 15px;"></i>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Button -->
        <div style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <button class="btn btn-ember" id="resize-submit-btn" disabled onclick="executeResize()">
            <i data-lucide="minimize-2" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
            <span id="resize-btn-text">Compress &amp; Optimize File</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Progress Track -->
        <div id="resize-progress-wrap" class="progress-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          <div class="progress-meta">
            <span id="resize-prog-status">Optimizing file...</span>
            <span id="resize-prog-percent">0%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track">
            <div id="resize-progress-bar" class="progress-bar"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Result Card -->
        <div id="resize-result-card" class="result-card" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <div class="result-header">
            <i data-lucide="check-circle" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; color: #16a34a;"></i>
            <span>File Optimization Complete</span>
          </div>
          <div class="result-metrics">
            <span id="resize-result-metrics">Saved</span>
            <span id="resize-result-savings" class="badge" style="display: none; margin-left: 0.5rem; background: #ecfdf5; color: #15803d; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 9999px;"></span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <a id="resize-download-btn" href="#" class="btn btn-primary" download>
              <i data-lucide="download" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i> Download Optimized File
            </a>
            <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="clearResizeFile()">
              <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"></i> Optimize Another File
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================================
         5. HELP & FAQS VIEW
         ====================================================================== -->
    <div id="view-faq" class="studio-view">
      <div class="broadsheet-card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Help &amp; Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Quick guides and answers to common questions about file conversions, security, and AutoCAD batch plotting.
        </p>

        <div class="faq-container" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
          
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <i data-lucide="file-spreadsheet" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
                <span>How do I convert an Excel spreadsheet directly to PDF?</span>
              </div>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              Click the <strong>Excel to PDF</strong> card in the File Converter tab. Drop your <code>.xlsx</code> or <code>.xls</code> workbook, and click <strong>Convert to PDF</strong>. The table headers, borders, and rows are automatically rendered into a crisp vector PDF.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <i data-lucide="printer" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
                <span>How does AutoCAD Batch Plotting work?</span>
              </div>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              Switch to the <strong>AutoCAD Batch Plot</strong> tab. Select your plotter, paper size (ANSI/ISO), and plot style (e.g. <code>Circuitizer.ctb</code> or <code>monochrome.ctb</code>). Drop 1 to 50+ DWG drawings and click <strong>Execute AutoCAD Batch Plot</strong>. The installed AutoCAD 2026 Core Console plots them with true lineweights, all layers turned on, and zooms to extents.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <i data-lucide="lock" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
                <span>Are my files private and secure?</span>
              </div>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              Yes. 100% of conversions, batch plots, and merges run locally on your system. No files are ever sent to third-party cloud servers.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <i data-lucide="layers" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
                <span>How can I merge multiple documents and drawings into one PDF?</span>
              </div>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              Switch to the <strong>Merge Files</strong> tab. Drop PDF specifications, Word documents (<code>.docx</code>), and architectural images. You can reorder the files in the queue and merge them into a single PDF portfolio.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <i data-lucide="shield-check" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
                <span>How do I protect or redact a PDF?</span>
              </div>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              In the File Converter tab, select <strong>Protect PDF</strong> to lock the file with AES-256 encryption. Or choose <strong>Redact PDF</strong> and enter sensitive keywords to permanently black them out and purge them from the document.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <i data-lucide="award" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--zapier-orange);"></i>
                <span>Who designed, engineered and built I LOVE FILES?</span>
              </div>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron" style="width: 18px; height: 18px;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <strong>I LOVE FILES</strong> is designed, engineered, and maintained by <strong>Musthaque Ali</strong> (&copy; 2026 Musthaque Ali. All Rights Reserved). Built with native AutoCAD Core Console plotting, resilient 3-tier Office/PDF engines, and zero cloud data leakage.
            </div>
          </div> <!-- /#view-resize -->

        </div> <!-- /#studio-bento-content -->

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
